@startuml SD5_Study_Session_Pomodoro
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true

title UC-SESS-01: Thực thi Phiên học Tập trung (Study Session Execution)\nTuân thủ: DDD Aggregate Root Separation & BUSR-08 (Concurrency Check 409)

actor "Learner" as User
box "FrontendDMZ" #F8F9FA
    participant "Study Workspace\n(Next.js Client)" as UI
end box
box "Presentation Layer" #E9ECEF
    participant "SessionRouter\n(FastAPI)" as Router
end box
box "Application Layer" #DEE2E6
    participant "StudySessionUC\n(Use Case)" as SessionUC
end box
box "Domain Layer" #E2E3E5
    participant "StudySession\n(Domain Entity)" as SessionEntity
    participant "Task\n(Domain Entity)" as TaskEntity
    participant "SessionTask\n(Association Entity)" as SessionTaskEntity
end box
box "Infrastructure & Persistence" #CED4DA
    participant "SqlSessionRepo\n(SessionRepoPort)" as SessionRepo
    participant "SqlTaskRepo\n(TaskRepoPort)" as TaskRepo
    participant "PostgreSQL 16\n(Database)" as DB
end box

== 1. Khởi tạo Phiên học (Start Session) ==
User -> UI: Chọn Task & Bấm [Bắt đầu Phiên học]
activate UI
UI -> Router: POST /api/v1/sessions\n{"task_ids": ["task_1"], "planned_minutes": 50}
activate Router

Router -> SessionUC: start_session(cmd: StartSessionCommand)
activate SessionUC

SessionUC -> SessionRepo: find_active_session_by_user(userId)
activate SessionRepo
SessionRepo -> DB: query_active_session(userId)
activate DB
DB --> SessionRepo: active_session_record (hoặc null)
deactivate DB

alt [Người học đang có phiên học dở dang (BUSR-08 Violated)]
    SessionRepo --> SessionUC: existingActiveSession
    deactivate SessionRepo
    SessionUC --> Router: throw ActiveSessionConflictException
    deactivate SessionUC
    Router --> UI: 409 Conflict {"error": "ACTIVE_SESSION_EXISTS", "active_session_id": "sess_099"}
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: Cảnh báo "Bạn đang có phiên học chưa kết thúc! Vui lòng hoàn thành hoặc hủy phiên trước."
else [Không có phiên dở dang - Khởi tạo phiên mới]
    SessionRepo --> SessionUC: null
    deactivate SessionRepo

    SessionUC -> SessionEntity: start(userId, roadmapId, plannedMinutes)
    activate SessionEntity
    SessionEntity --> SessionUC: sessionEntity (status="IN_PROGRESS")
    deactivate SessionEntity

    SessionUC -> SessionRepo: save_session(sessionEntity)
    activate SessionRepo
    SessionRepo -> DB: insert_study_session(sessionData)
    activate DB
    DB --> SessionRepo: session_id = "sess_101"
    deactivate DB
    SessionRepo --> SessionUC: persistedSession
    deactivate SessionRepo

    SessionUC --> Router: SessionStartedDTO(session_id="sess_101", status="IN_PROGRESS")
    deactivate SessionUC

    Router --> UI: 201 Created {"session_id": "sess_101"}
    deactivate Router

    UI --> User: Mở giao diện Pomodoro Workspace, đếm ngược thời gian
end
deactivate UI

== 2. Đồng bộ Nhịp tim định kỳ (Mỗi 60s bảo vệ thời lượng) ==
loop Mỗi 60 giây trong phiên (Heartbeat Sync)
    UI -> Router: POST /api/v1/sessions/sess_101/heartbeat\n{"actual_minutes": X}
    activate Router
    Router -> SessionUC: record_heartbeat(session_id="sess_101", actual_minutes=X)
    activate SessionUC
    SessionUC -> SessionRepo: find_by_id("sess_101")
    activate SessionRepo
    SessionRepo -> DB: query_session_by_id("sess_101")
    activate DB
    DB --> SessionRepo: sessionRecord
    deactivate DB
    SessionRepo --> SessionUC: sessionEntity
    deactivate SessionRepo

    SessionUC -> SessionEntity: recordHeartbeat()
    activate SessionEntity
    SessionEntity --> SessionUC: updatedSession
    deactivate SessionEntity

    SessionUC -> SessionRepo: update_heartbeat(sessionEntity)
    activate SessionRepo
    SessionRepo -> DB: update_session_heartbeat("sess_101", X, timestamp)
    activate DB
    DB --> SessionRepo: OK
    deactivate DB
    SessionRepo --> SessionUC: OK
    deactivate SessionRepo

    SessionUC --> Router: HeartbeatAckDTO(synced_minutes=X)
    deactivate SessionUC
    Router --> UI: 200 OK {"ack": true, "synced_minutes": X}
    deactivate Router
end

== 3. Hoàn tất Phiên học (Finish Session - DDD Boundary Compliance) ==
User -> UI: Đánh dấu Task hoàn thành & Bấm [Kết thúc Phiên]
activate UI
UI -> Router: POST /api/v1/sessions/sess_101/finish\n{"completed_task_ids": ["task_1"], "takeaways": "..."}
activate Router

Router -> SessionUC: finish_session(cmd: FinishSessionCommand)
activate SessionUC

SessionUC -> SessionRepo: find_by_id("sess_101")
activate SessionRepo
SessionRepo -> DB: query_session_by_id("sess_101")
activate DB
DB --> SessionRepo: sessionRecord
deactivate DB
SessionRepo --> SessionUC: sessionEntity
deactivate SessionRepo

SessionUC -> SessionEntity: finish(takeaways)
activate SessionEntity
SessionEntity --> SessionUC: sessionEntity (status="COMPLETED")
deactivate SessionEntity

SessionUC -> TaskRepo: find_tasks_by_ids(["task_1"])
activate TaskRepo
TaskRepo -> DB: query_tasks_by_ids(["task_1"])
activate DB
DB --> TaskRepo: taskRecords
deactivate DB
TaskRepo --> SessionUC: taskEntities
deactivate TaskRepo

SessionUC -> TaskEntity: markCompleted()
activate TaskEntity
TaskEntity --> SessionUC: updatedTaskEntity (status="COMPLETED")
deactivate TaskEntity

' Phân tách ranh giới Aggregate Root qua Application Transaction
note over SessionUC, DB: Giao dịch nguyên tử điều phối tại Application Layer (Unit of Work):\n1. SessionRepo cập nhật aggregate StudySession\n2. TaskRepo cập nhật aggregate Task\n3. SessionRepo cập nhật liên kết session_tasks
SessionUC -> SessionRepo: save_session(sessionEntity)
activate SessionRepo
SessionRepo -> DB: update_study_session_status(session_id, 'COMPLETED', ended_at)
activate DB
DB --> SessionRepo: OK
deactivate DB
SessionRepo --> SessionUC: OK
deactivate SessionRepo

SessionUC -> TaskRepo: save_tasks([taskEntity])
activate TaskRepo
TaskRepo -> DB: update_tasks_status([task_id], 'COMPLETED', completed_at)
activate DB
DB --> TaskRepo: OK
deactivate DB
TaskRepo --> SessionUC: OK
deactivate TaskRepo

SessionUC --> Router: SessionFinishedDTO(session_id="sess_101", status="COMPLETED")
deactivate SessionUC

Router --> UI: 200 OK {"status": "COMPLETED", "message": "Session finished"}
deactivate Router

UI --> User: Hiển thị màn hình Tổng kết thành tựu & Chúc mừng hoàn thành!
deactivate UI

@enduml
